  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water and a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil. Add jasmine rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat. Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd20a18b4d4424a20898f9-2da9f962.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Trim baby broccoli. Halve any thicker stalks of baby broccoli lengthways.\n• In a small bowl, combine mayonnaise and the soy sauce. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd20a18b4d4424a20898f9-2568f678.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot and baby broccoli with a splash of water, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Season with salt and pepper. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes. Remove pan from heat, then add garlic stir-fry sauce, stiring to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd20a18b4d4424a20898f9-e594b3ad.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with veggies and garlic plant-based mince, spooning over any remaining sauce from pan.\n• Drizzle with soy mayo. Sprinkle with crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd20a18b4d4424a20898f9-87ca1f50.jpeg"
    }
  ]
